REPORT OF INVESTIGATION
<br><br>

Surface Nonmetal Mine<br>
(Limestone)<br>
<br>

Fatal Other Accident (Drowning)<br>
December 13, 2004
<br><br>

Jobe Concrete Products Inc.<br>
McKelligon Canyon<br>
El Paso, El Paso County, Texas<br>
Mine ID No. 41-00046

<br><br>

Investigators
<br><br>
Gary L. Cook<br>
Supervisory Mine Safety and Health Inspector
<br><br>
Stephen R. Kirk<br>
Mine Safety and Health Inspector
<br><br>
Steve M. Powroznik<br>
Mine Safety and Health Specialist

<br><br>

Originating Office<br>
